Officer Smith is a patrolman of the [[Org/Blackline/index|Blackline]], the subscription police company in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. He is the talkative half of a pair, friendly and quick to give his badge number. He and his silent partner Mute have patrolled the poorer streets around [[Org/Sableclutch Scrap/index|Sableclutch Scrap]] for a few weeks. He has offered to pass word to [[Copperjaw]] if the pickpocket who ran off near the scrapyard is caught.
